364
00:22:07,778 --> 00:22:08,608
I can't be afraid!

365
00:22:08,691 --> 00:22:09,521
I can't be afraid!

366
00:22:09,604 --> 00:22:10,434
I'm scared.

367
00:22:10,517 --> 00:22:13,005
I can't be afraid!

368
